==Description==
The '''Frozen''' was an ice elemental [[Enemies|enemy]]. It had average speed (about the same as the [[Normal]]) and had the same amount of health as the [[Chained Boss|Chained]]. It was immune to the [[Freezer]]'s basic freeze.

==Appearance==
The '''Frozen''' had light blue skin and was faceless. It had a granite torso and legs. Its legs were slightly darker than its torso, both being dark blue. Its head shape was unique as it was not round, with some part sticking out of the head.

==Strategy==
*The [[Rocketeer|Rocketer]] and [[Demoman]] can easily wipe out hordes of these.
*The [[Pyromancer]] can be used to slow these down to allow your towers more time to kill this.
*Despite being an ice elemental enemy, this can be frozen by the [[Freezer]]'s ''Ice Drop'' ability.
*High damage towers such as the [[Turret]] and [[Minigunner]] can deal with the '''Frozen'''.

